2272:# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- parent thread (lineage)
2273:#
2274:# A thread belongs to one reviewer lineage '<provider>/<model>' on one endpoint
2275:# (provider_fingerprint). Only a ledger entry written by 0.3.0 or later (it has a
2276:# `reviewer`) whose identity was resolved (non-empty provider_fingerprint) and whose
2277:# `thread` was verified (from the events, or a rollout that contains the consultation
2278:# id) can be a parent - automatically (the newest of this run's lineage) or through
2279:# -Thread. Entries recorded before 0.3.0 have UNKNOWN provenance: never a parent. A
2280:# rollout candidate (thread_candidate) is diagnostic only: never a parent.
2281:
2282:function Get-EntryFingerprint {
2283:    param($Entry)
2284:    $rev = Get-PropertyValue $Entry 'reviewer' $null
2285:    if ($null -eq $rev) { return '' }
2286:    return [string](Get-PropertyValue $rev 'provider_fingerprint' '')
2287:}
